  "source_sha256": "3ba7b5adfca4454a7b8b38d4f49e5cc365b347ddb905b864cd4bf2e2eb376af9",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "76c324f9d10fd5efec1023394a80a2c01a2ae3e219d2f755005488080fa0810b",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nPainting Class",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5410367716a4678f460cae644d940fbb5818c1f3d504557b92df2bc9aa47824e",
      "text": "“What will you paint?”\nasked the teacher.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cf5826a0dd551271cbbc4b855184cbdb9fd51812a1125441b8bf09047507a42a",
      "text": "“A unicorn!” said Nezha.\n“Mine will have rainbow hair!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "29b5636b3cf799f01e8523118790fe4186bb5ff7ee69ccc344224b2a1e27039d",
      "text": "“A bunny,” said Pigsy.\n“Look at these long ears!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "52c11bcc13ec6655f054c13a7853ecd0d8d3ada9287ff4e967f3c90e9a813481",
      "text": "“A unicorn for me, too!”\nsaid Wukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "30928db85140b357d3d10169c94912d5d74df017f706c5a71d767b407282d67d",
      "text": "He mixed red and blue.\nHe mixed in yellow.\nSwish, swish, swish.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e03668f0a4444b2f01870355f9a048ea34d41e86f58faea0cdbcd331c07c3ab3",
      "text": "Wukong looked at his paper.\n“My unicorn is\na round brown blob!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e782f9a6cc101bf2dc63d15edbc484a244944fde11b2e9bbbaf9f25bb8105b47",
      "text": "The teacher looked, too.\n“What can that blob be?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "43644dd446ac1368d67335242e6dcc90dfe1da04b90a4cd007b695885a451260",
      "text": "He painted two round ears.\nThe blob was a bear!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3057634a5c566c76186cf9f74d093d93824ac0eeca0f739107356642c62cd626",
      "text": "Two eyes. One nose.\nA happy little smile.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "32c8d86bae8ee4f356668686efe387f09499eb1e31f195b388dc506791570614",
      "text": "Nezha painted rainbow hair.\nPigsy painted pink\ninside the bunny’s ears.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ae2976f5a5a7c1da2f109d144723200db067dd7c8fd7a1de4a5c8b8a3335d014",
      "text": "“Can we paint together?”\n“Yes!” said his friends.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f4889209923d353285226af0e44da4505d3089fa3c0b319284bb5f0cdd26fc67",
      "text": "They painted green grass.\nThey painted a little path.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "24e59aa3535b73767301ed09e2b4ed3be7e1d1410e82150051a2aa95d5d45a38",
      "text": "Wukong painted a pillow\nby his bear.\n“Painting is hard work!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cffc44225e81ed48eea24a2eee6dfaa0cd8d0fb4b4a1b3da82f1275108598c7e",
      "text": "They washed their brushes.\nThey put up their picture.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2f4c0a2b2db7f47183b7207e11182f57d22860f6d2f934767abd955eb142ea31",
      "text": "“We made this together!”\nsaid Wukong.\n“Sleep well, little bear.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b94c8febe5feb6a7e982144d0c240be01010efc5f336537724b56e5cfcd50ae",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.",
